{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411090","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1241109001:1":{"text":"嘿，仓鼠小骑士，你还好吧？怎么一脸马上要昏过去的样子？","source_cn":"嘿，仓鼠小骑士，你还好吧？怎么一脸马上要昏过去的样子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1CE2836D691EEBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241109002:1":{"text":"不好……很不好！","source_cn":"不好……很不好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DEB7121EA7C505A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241109003:1":{"text":"到处都是水……大海，湖泊，河流，小溪……","source_cn":"到处都是水……大海，湖泊，河流，小溪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7E51BB28DE5743E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241109004:1":{"text":"满满现在一看到水，就会回想起溺水后那种快要窒息的感觉……","source_cn":"满满现在一看到水，就会回想起溺水后那种快要窒息的感觉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x214AD0A5B624EC4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1241109004":{"text":"满满现在一看到水，就会回想起溺水后那种快要窒息的感觉……","source_cn":"满满现在一看到水，就会回想起溺水后那种快要窒息的感觉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x214AD0A5B624EC4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241109005:1":{"text":"主人你又忘了！最开始弃船的时候，我们一起游到了小岛上！满满会游泳！","source_cn":"主人你又忘了！最开始弃船的时候，我们一起游到了小岛上！...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6441608CB5867DB1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"主人你又忘了！最开始弃船的时候，我们一起游到了小岛上！满满会游泳！","female":"主人你又忘了！最开始弃船的时候，我们一起游到了小岛上！满满会游泳！","variant_male_record_index":"137453","variant_female_record_index":"137454","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241109006:1":{"text":"那你之前还被呛得够呛？","source_cn":"那你之前还被呛得够呛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09B131A6A28C0D9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241109007:1":{"text":"……那是因为这身骑士盔甲太沉了！","source_cn":"……那是因为这身骑士盔甲太沉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B89CE05A4A3A8E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241109008:1":{"text":"还有这把沉甸甸的骑士剑！满满为了拿起它，可是拼命锻炼了很久呢！","source_cn":"还有这把沉甸甸的骑士剑！满满为了拿起它，可是拼命锻炼了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x995B593FFCA15043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1241109008":{"text":"还有这把沉甸甸的骑士剑！满满为了拿起它，可是拼命锻炼了很久呢！","source_cn":"还有这把沉甸甸的骑士剑！满满为了拿起它，可是拼命锻炼了很久呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x995B593FFCA15043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241109009:1":{"text":"这话说的没错。和自己的小命比起来，再昂贵的东西也会变得一文不值。更何况只是一具盔甲，一把剑。","source_cn":"这话说的没错。和自己的小命比起来，再昂贵的东西也会变得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AF6B67B56BCC442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241109010:1":{"text":"虽然我在这方面见识不多，但一眼就能看出来，你这两样东西可不怎么值钱啊。坑坑洼洼，破破烂烂——","source_cn":"虽然我在这方面见识不多，但一眼就能看出来，你这两样东西...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45001E8A355716C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241109011:1":{"text":"——你！你怎么能单纯用金钱来衡量它们的价值？！","source_cn":"——你！你怎么能单纯用金钱来衡量它们的价值？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0751A9BFB633A1F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241109012:1":{"text":"对于一名骑士来说，盔甲和剑就是荣誉的象征，怎么能轻易放弃呢！！","source_cn":"对于一名骑士来说，盔甲和剑就是荣誉的象征，怎么能轻易放...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D7D567AB6C82CAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241109013:1":{"text":"而且它们还是我为保护主人而量身打造的，是独一无二的宝物，绝对不是用钱就能买到的东西！","source_cn":"而且它们还是我为保护主人而量身打造的，是独一无二的宝物...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B11758A26AC4EA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"而且它们还是我为保护主人而量身打造的，是独一无二的宝物，绝对不是用钱就能买到的东西！","female":"而且它们还是我为保护主人而量身打造的，是独一无二的宝物，绝对不是用钱就能买到的东西！","variant_male_record_index":"137462","variant_female_record_index":"137463","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241109014:1":{"text":"要是真的搞丢了它们……满满也没脸再当主人的使魔了！","source_cn":"要是真的搞丢了它们……满满也没脸再当主人的使魔了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3074617FB6121513","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"要是真的搞丢了它们……满满也没脸再当主人的使魔了！","female":"要是真的搞丢了它们……满满也没脸再当主人的使魔了！","variant_male_record_index":"137464","variant_female_record_index":"137465","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241109015:1":{"text":"……好吧好吧，你还真是个死脑——啊不，你真是一位称职的骑士。","source_cn":"……好吧好吧，你还真是个死脑——啊不，你真是一位称职的骑士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA485093675F77E8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241109016:1":{"text":"但愿风浪与漂泊之神保佑你，别让你再掉进水里。","source_cn":"但愿风浪与漂泊之神保佑你，别让你再掉进水里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC681419F78A697B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241109017:1":{"text":"满满已经在克服了，溺水这种事……绝对不会发生第二次！","source_cn":"满满已经在克服了，溺水这种事……绝对不会发生第二次！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A784565CA27603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"其实你可以放弃它们……","source_cn":"其实你可以放弃它们……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x47400B5E409859C1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"其实你可以放弃它们……","female":"其实你可以放弃它们……","variant_male_record_index":"66918","variant_female_record_index":"66919","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"还是活命更重要！","source_cn":"还是活命更重要！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB4936665199AA7D9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"还是活命更重要！","female":"还是活命更重要！","variant_male_record_index":"66920","variant_female_record_index":"66921","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"你不会游泳吗？","source_cn":"你不会游泳吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD03CD4B76BFC068B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你不会游泳吗？","female":"你不会游泳吗？","variant_male_record_index":"66914","variant_female_record_index":"66915","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"是时候教你游泳了","source_cn":"是时候教你游泳了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xECB850BB6357756B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"是时候教你游泳了","female":"是时候教你游泳了","variant_male_record_index":"66916","variant_female_record_index":"66917","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"辛巴达","source":"辛巴达","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":2}}